13
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:16,000
The film stars his sister Gwyneth Paltrow, Penélope Cruz, Martin
Freeman, Danny DeVito, Simon Pegg and others.

14
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:26,000
The movie takes place in London and New York City, where a former pop star (Freeman) who
now writes commercial jingles for a living experiences a mid-life crisis.

15
